{
  "$schema": "../schema/flow.schema.json",
  "version": "2",
  "id": "transaction-create",
  "title": "Create transaction",
  "layout": "TB",
  "twin": "transaction-create-seq",
  "overview": [
    "Creates a payment transaction: the user submits a request, the API validates it, funds are charged through the payment gateway, and the transaction is persisted.",
    "The Charge payment step drills into its own sub-flow (payment-charge), which in turn links to the low-level execution sequence (charge-sequence)."
  ],
  "actors": [
    { "id": "user", "label": "User", "kind": "human" },
    { "id": "api", "label": "Transaction API", "kind": "service" },
    { "id": "payment", "label": "Payment Gateway", "kind": "system" },
    { "id": "db", "label": "Database", "kind": "infra" }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    { "id": "start", "type": "terminal", "text": "Start", "details": "Entry point of the flow." },
    {
      "id": "submit",
      "type": "step",
      "text": "Submit request",
      "owner": "user",
      "details": "- User submits the CreateTxDTO form.\n- Amount and currency are required."
    },
    {
      "id": "validate",
      "type": "step",
      "text": "Validate request",
      "owner": "api",
      "details": "- Checks limits and currency.\n- Rejects out-of-range amounts.",
      "source": { "file": "src/tx/controller.ts", "symbol": "TxService.validate", "line": 42 }
    },
    {
      "id": "check.amount",
      "type": "decision",
      "text": "amount > 0?",
      "owner": "api",
      "details": "Branches on whether the amount is positive."
    },
    {
      "id": "charge",
      "type": "subflow",
      "text": "Charge payment",
      "owner": "payment",
      "shared": true,
      "subflow": "payment-charge",
      "details": "- Calls the payment gateway to authorize and capture funds.\n- Retries once on transient failure.\n- Emits a charge result before the row is persisted.",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "amount", "type": "number" }, { "name": "card", "type": "Card" }],
      "outputs": [{ "name": "chargeId", "type": "string" }, { "name": "status", "type": "ChargeStatus" }],
      "source": { "file": "src/adapters/payment.ts", "symbol": "PaymentAdapter.charge", "line": 88 },
      "refs": [{ "label": "Payment gateway API docs", "url": "https://example.com/payments/api" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "insert",
      "type": "step",
      "text": "Insert transaction",
      "owner": "db",
      "details": "Persists the transaction row.",
      "source": { "file": "src/tx/repository.ts", "symbol": "TxRepository.insert" }
    },
    {
      "id": "reject",
      "type": "step",
      "text": "Reject",
      "owner": "api",
      "details": "Returns a validation error to the caller."
    },
    { "id": "done", "type": "terminal", "text": "Done", "details": "Flow complete." }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "from": "start", "to": "submit", "type": "flow" },
    {
      "from": "submit",
      "to": "validate",
      "type": "flow",
      "details": "The submitted CreateTxDTO is handed to the API for validation."
    },
    { "from": "validate", "to": "check.amount", "type": "flow" },
    {
      "id": "to-charge",
      "from": "check.amount",
      "to": "charge",
      "type": "branch",
      "text": "yes",
      "details": "- Amount is positive → proceed to charge.\n- Carries the validated amount and card into the charge sub-process.",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "amount", "type": "number" }, { "name": "card", "type": "Card" }],
      "subflow": "payment-charge"
    },
    { "from": "check.amount", "to": "reject", "type": "branch", "text": "no" },
    { "from": "charge", "to": "insert", "type": "flow" },
    { "from": "insert", "to": "done", "type": "flow" },
    { "from": "reject", "to": "done", "type": "flow" }
  ]
}
